{"root":{"data":{"id":"77257d45b484","created":1619742020,"text":"设计模式就该这样学"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0mouvo6g00","created":1619742201324,"text":"重新认识UML","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0oy5o06cw0","created":1619748572302,"text":"图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0oyflvmko0","created":1619748593941,"text":"结构图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0ozz7x0c00","created":1619748714997,"text":"静态图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p1cyws880","created":1619748823292,"text":"类图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p1fyr0m80","created":1619748829812,"text":"对象图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrdvvc00w0","created":1621989766071,"text":"对象图是显示了一组对象和他们之间的关系"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p1ip6odk0","created":1619748835764,"text":"包图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrehn4avs0","created":1621989813463,"text":"各个包以及包之间关系的描述"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p025rd280","created":1619748721397,"text":"实现图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p1op3h2o0","created":1619748848820,"text":"构件图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrg25u7w00","created":1621989936495,"text":"各构件间的依赖关系"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p06p0uds0","created":1619748731269,"text":"组合机构图"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oyiwjt800","created":1619748601117,"text":"行为图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p0eosm7s0","created":1619748748669,"text":"活动图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmribgp5e80","created":1621990113471,"text":"明确地说明了整个控制流的过程"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p0ia6nz40","created":1619748756493,"text":"状态图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrjlzf0i80","created":1621990214735,"text":"描述对象具有的各种状态、状态之间的转换过程以及触发状态转换的各种事件和条件"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p0l7dcwg0","created":1619748762853,"text":"用例图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrkeq22bs0","created":1621990277295,"text":"用例图是用来描述系统功能的技术，用例图的基本组成元素：参与者、用例、元素之间的关系"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oymn3zo00","created":1619748609253,"text":"交互图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p0tfbzq80","created":1619748780749,"text":"时序图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrlj6vpcw0","created":1621990365384,"text":"描述对象之间发送消息的时间顺序显示多个对象之间的动态协作"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p0wzenq80","created":1619748788493,"text":"时间图"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmrm1cuheo0","created":1621990404927,"text":"时间图被用来显示随时间变化，一个或多个元素的值或状态的更改"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p11q2bww0","created":1619748798812,"text":"交互概览图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p16urajc0","created":1619748809980,"text":"协作图"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oy97nl4g0","created":1619748580021,"text":"关系","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0oyu08vo80","created":1619748625285,"text":"关联"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oyydkqlc0","created":1619748634798,"text":"聚合"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oz1alx340","created":1619748641149,"text":"组合"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oz6kzpmo0","created":1619748652661,"text":"泛化"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0ozd04vyw0","created":1619748666637,"text":"实现"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0ozfmbo8w0","created":1619748672333,"text":"依赖"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0oyc4kvs00","created":1619748586365,"text":"事务","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0ozj3hnc00","created":1619748679901,"text":"结构事务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p28jjw9c0","created":1619748892020,"text":"类"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p2aycimo0","created":1619748897268,"text":"接口"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p2e6n0co0","created":1619748904300,"text":"用例"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p2gjbfkw0","created":1619748909420,"text":"协作"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p2jdzjcg0","created":1619748915628,"text":"组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p2oy5xdc0","created":1619748927732,"text":"活动类"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p2u2qbk00","created":1619748938892,"text":"节点"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0ozm6i3io0","created":1619748686613,"text":"行为事务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p2wqnov40","created":1619748944692,"text":"交互"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0p312s18g0","created":1619748954132,"text":"状态"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0ozowedm80","created":1619748692533,"text":"分组事务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p34a0jao0","created":1619748961100,"text":"包"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0ozsr2eu80","created":1619748700917,"text":"注释事务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0p36651sg0","created":1619748965220,"text":"注释"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mp4t0yco0","created":1619742222932,"text":"设计模式常用的UML图","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0muqji3ow0","created":1619742662066,"text":"类图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mutuz7t40","created":1619742669290,"text":"时序图"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mpfe7d8g0","created":1619742245980,"text":"七大软件架构设计原则","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5spnukrfc0","created":1620266990827,"text":"学习设计原则是学习设计模式的基础。在实际开发过程中，并不是一定要求所有代码都遵循\n设计原则，而是要综合考虑人力、时间、成本、质量 不刻意追求完美，要在适当的场景遵循设\n计原则 。这体现的是一种平衡取舍，可以帮助我们设计出更加优雅的代码结构 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mv09ksio0","created":1619742683234,"text":"开闭原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0uw0sx08g0","created":1619765331646,"text":"通常程序只支持扩展，不支持修改。这就是开闭原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5sr6y7hog0","created":1620267110770,"text":"开闭原则 \n对扩展开放，对修改关闭 \n降低维护带来的新风险"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mv5neqhc0","created":1619742694954,"text":"依赖倒置原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0vfgpxzc00","created":1619766855214,"text":"A高层次的模块不应该依赖于低层次的模块，他们都应该依赖于抽象。\nB.抽象不应该依赖于具体实现，具体实现应该依赖于抽象。（比如接口）","layout_right_offset":{"x":49.99999821186066,"y":0}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5srdm7ijc0","created":1620267125282,"text":"高层不应该依赖低层 \n更利于代码结构的升级扩展"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mvcg1n1k0","created":1619742709746,"text":"单一职责原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0vi6840l40","created":1619767067461,"text":"职责P1和职责P2。当因为职责P1的需求发生改变而需要修改类T的时候，有可能会导致原本运行正常的职责P2功能发生故障"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5srmcb13c0","created":1620267144274,"text":"一个类只干件事 \n便于理解，提高代码的可读性"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mvtbqads0","created":1619742746490,"text":"接口隔离原则","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0w0omahi00","created":1619768518055,"text":"类间的依赖关系应该建立在最小的接口上"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0w2r3ktt40","created":1619768680182,"text":"接口的设计粒度越小，系统越灵活，这是不争的事实。但是，灵活的同时也带来了结构的复杂化，开发难度增加，可维护性降低，这不是一个项目或产品所期望看到的，所以接口设计一定要注意适度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5srtt0ugo0","created":1620267160522,"text":"一个接口只干一件事 \n功能解剿，高~合、低鹅合"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mvyd4cb40","created":1619742757458,"text":"迪米特法则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0wnmrzh5s0","created":1619770316422,"text":"尽量降低类与类之间的耦合（例子类里面不要定义类，用传参的方式）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5sry3oezs0","created":1620267169874,"text":"不该知道的不要知道 \n只和朋友交流，不和陌生人说话，减少代码\n脆肿"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mwbd7pao0","created":1619742785762,"text":"里氏替换原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5r1a26zww0","created":1620262258963,"text":"子类可以替换父类，里氏代换原则是对“开-闭”原则的补充"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5ssaendhc0","created":1620267196658,"text":"子类重写方法功能发生改变，不应该影响父类方法\n的含义 防止继承泛滥"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mxg4pbew0","created":1619742874496,"text":"合成复用原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5scgmvnpk0","created":1620265956390,"text":"合成复用原则就是在一个新的对象里通过关联关系（包括组合关系和聚合关系）来使用一些已有的对象，使之成为新对象的一部分；新对象通过委派调用已有对象的方法达到复用功能的目的。简言之：复用时要尽量使用组合/聚合关系（关联关系），少用继承"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5ssn5qt940","created":1620267224418,"text":"尽量使用组合实现代码复用，而不使用继承 降低代码销合"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mpu1krvs0","created":1619742277868,"text":"关于设计模式的那些事儿"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mq5gn3ug0","created":1619742302724,"text":"创建型设计模式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5tk7kb8fs0","created":1620269384667,"text":"工厂模式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5tl3dsi200","created":1620269453930,"text":"在日\n常开发中，凡是需要生成复杂对象的地方，都可以尝试考虑使用工广模式来代替。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0my23mnww0","created":1619742922320,"text":"简单工厂模式（test01）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5w76id37k0","created":1620276826968,"text":"简单工厂模式的工厂类 ，负责所有产品的创建，但当产品基数增多时，工厂 代码会非\n常腕肿 ，违背高聚合原则"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0my8bhks00","created":1619742935856,"text":"工厂方法模式(test02)","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5y46snghs0","created":1620282234717,"text":"典型的解藕框架。高层模块只需要知道产品的抽象类，无须关心其他实现类，满足迪米\n特法则、依赖倒置原则和里氏替换原则。3)抽象产品只能生产一种产品，此弊端可使用抽象工厂模式解决。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0myglz1vc0","created":1619742953904,"text":"抽象工厂模式（test03）","priority":2},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb5yu6g0weo0","created":1620284271422,"text":"规定了所有可能被创建的产品集合，产品族中扩展新的产品困难，需要修改抽象工厂\n的接口.  增加了系统的难理解性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb7p6e8yppk0","created":1620460137594,"text":"spring中用到了"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mym6y9k00","created":1619742966057,"text":"单例模式(test04)","priority":4},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb6oj1iekio0","created":1620356747534,"text":"单例模式可以保证内存里只有一个实例，减少了内存的开销."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb7p6279oyw0","created":1620460111370,"text":"spring中用到节省内存"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0myro82go0","created":1619742977985,"text":"原型模式(test05)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb6t1532nvk0","created":1620369450309,"text":"重写clone()方法，只会深克隆类和类中所有非基本数据类型的属性对应的类。对于类中的属性对应的类，是无法深克隆的，如果深克隆类中的属性对应的类，需要额外的调用类中的属性对应的类clone方法"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0myxhsty80","created":1619742990657,"text":"建造者模式(test06)","priority":3},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb7oahnvdmo0","created":1620457637372,"text":"如果将抽象工厂模式看成汽车配件生产工厂，生产一个产品族的产品，那么建造者模式就是一个汽车组装工厂，通过对部件的组装可以返回一辆完整的汽车","layout_right_offset":{"x":72.99998629201582,"y":-1}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb7p5grsnwg0","created":1620460064722,"text":"date jpa  sql 拼接 jdk源码StringBuilder的append方法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb7pno410ds0","created":1620461491254,"text":"使用环境（1）需要生成的产品对象的属性相互依赖，需要指定其生成顺序\n（2）需要生成的产品对象有复杂的内部结构，这些产品通常包含多个成员变量\n（3）对象的创建过程独立于创建该对象的类。在建造者模式中通过引入指挥者类，将创建过程封装在指挥者类中，而不在建造这类和客户类中\n（4）隔离复杂对象的创建和使用，并使得相同的创建过程创建不同的产品"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mqk894iw0","created":1619742334868,"text":"结构型设计模式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0mzcx2nm80","created":1619743024232,"text":"代理模式(test07)","priority":3},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbmvbru0emg0","created":1622000884995,"text":"代理模式又叫委托模式，是为某个对象提供一个代理对象，并且由代理对象控制对原对象的访问。代理模式通俗来讲就是我们生活中常见的中介"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mzh0pp1c0","created":1619743033160,"text":"门面模式(外观模式)（test08）","priority":4},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbojkasv19s0","created":1622170819792,"text":"门面模式又叫做外观模式，提供了一个统一的接口，用来访问子系统一群接口，比如jar和第三方sdk"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cboke0vcfxc0","created":1622173149099,"text":"SpringJDBC下的jdbcUtils和MyBatis源码的Configuration 有很多new开头的 tomcat源码  requesFacade类为例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mzoouefc0","created":1619743049856,"text":"装饰器模式（包装模式）（test09）","priority":2},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbomomyluhc0","created":1622179623047,"text":"装饰器模式提供了比继承更有弹性的替代方案(扩展原有对象的功 〉将功能附加到对象上.\n因此 装饰器模式的核心是功能扩展 使用装饰器模式可以透明且动态地扩展类的功能. )动态地给 个对象添加功能，这些功能可以再动态地被撤销."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbonv4u6wr40","created":1622182953257,"text":"jdk源码 IO BufferedReader InputStream OlltpllutStrcam 事务缓存TransactionAwareCacheDccorator 装饰这模式是代理模式一个特殊应用，两种所面向的面的功能扩展面不一样"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mzvhl8mg0","created":1619743064655,"text":"享元模式(轻量级模式)(test10)","priority":6},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cboofcbgekw0","created":1622184536822,"text":"解决java中有某个对象大量创建从而降低内存消耗本质就是缓存多处使用,享元模式其实是工广方法模式的一个改进机制"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n07f2amg0","created":1619743090624,"text":"组合模式(整体部分模式)(test11)","priority":5},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbopsaikuk80","created":1622188372743,"text":"可以清楚地定义分层次的复杂对象，表示对象的全部或部分层次，使得增加新构件也更容易。\n客户端调用简单，客户端可以一致的使用组合结构或其中单个对象。\n定义了包含叶子对象和容器对象的类层次结构，叶子对象可以被组合成更复杂的容器对象，而这个容器对象又可以被组合，这样不断递归下去，可以形成复杂的树形结构。\n更容易在组合体内加入对象构件，客户端不必因为加入了新的对象构件而更改原有代码"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n0fio4y00","created":1619743108256,"text":"适配器模式(test12)","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbswcag5fy00","created":1622613106366,"text":"适配器模式有非常多应用场景，例如，电源插转换头、\n手机充电转换头、显示器转接头等。的一个转换"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n0l3s5sw0","created":1619743120416,"text":"桥接模式（test13）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbswdz6rta00","created":1622613238582,"text":"当一个类内部具备两种或多种变化维度时 使用桥接模式可以解稿这些变化的维度，使高层\n代码架构稳定 桥接模式适用于以下几种业务场景"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mqs4u1dk0","created":1619742352076,"text":"行为型设计模式","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0n0v1wgi00","created":1619743142071,"text":"委派模式(test14)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbuldc0awuw0","created":1622785275829,"text":"通过任务委派能够将 个大型任务细化，然后通过统 管理这些子任务的完成情况实现任务\n的跟进 加快任务执行的效率","layout_right_offset":{"x":17.000010489333363,"y":0}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n0ynfth40","created":1619743149903,"text":"模板方法模式(test15)","priority":3},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbuldqc9nw80","created":1622785307028,"text":"模板方法模式实际上封装了一个固定流程 该流程由几个步骤组成，具体步骤可以由子类进\n行不同的实现，从而让固定的流程产生不同的结果"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n13xtyhs0","created":1619743161415,"text":"策略模式(test16)","priority":1},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbunm27wyx40","created":1622791602019,"text":"个类的行为或其算法可以在运行时更改"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n195kaco0","created":1619743172767,"text":"责任链模式(test17)","priority":2},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbup5zr774w0","created":1622795985048,"text":"类似部门中的oa系统，只处理自己范围内的  自己处理不了交给下个部门的人"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n1kk8l9c0","created":1619743197599,"text":"迭代器模式(test18)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbx02gc0fe00","created":1623029859801,"text":"提供一种方法顺序访问一个聚合对象中各个元素, 而又无须暴露该对象的内部表示"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n1t3zjo80","created":1619743216208,"text":"命令模式(Ttest19)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbx2eitq4hs0","created":1623036447815,"text":"行为请求者”与“行为实现者”进行松耦合"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n1xyw84o0","created":1619743226784,"text":"状态模式(test20)","priority":4},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n248qks80","created":1619743240439,"text":"备忘录模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n29znvxc0","created":1619743252951,"text":"中介者模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n2jh9wkg0","created":1619743273607,"text":"解释器模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n2rqk3r40","created":1619743291583,"text":"观察者模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n2yyjotc0","created":1619743307303,"text":"访问者模式"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mr365jqw0","created":1619742376100,"text":"设计模式总结篇","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0n8ue6es00","created":1619743767549,"text":"专治设计模式选择困难症","image":"","imageTitle":"","imageSize":"","layout_right_offset":{"x":-26.99999972798605,"y":0},"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0nw1ggeio0","created":1619745585300,"text":"一句话总结1","image":"https://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/02d0df52823065934ddb4a0f11e3afd53a31eb43","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":182,"height":200},"layout_right_offset":{"x":0,"y":-47.999997589804934}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0nweb8yvc0","created":1619745613284,"text":"一句话总结2","image":"https://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/a13e3dfc5fc3afe10d210b7b787858585008b0ae","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":82}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0n9bcqw2o0","created":1619743804468,"text":"容易混淆的设计模式对比"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0mrnbygdc0","created":1619742419987,"text":"架构设计扩展篇","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0n9uehlgo0","created":1619743845932,"text":"新设计模式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0namtv31s0","created":1619743907812,"text":"对象池模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0narnu94o0","created":1619743918332,"text":"规格模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0navmgqag0","created":1619743926956,"text":"空对象模式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0nazu3j8w0","created":1619743936124,"text":"雇工模式"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cb0na5ifuq00","created":1619743870116,"text":"软件架构与设计模式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cb0nb9jrci80","created":1619743957267,"text":"三层架构"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0nbgp3k5s0","created":1619743972827,"text":"ORM架构"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0nblllbq80","created":1619743983499,"text":"MVC架构"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cb0nbpv2gwg0","created":1619743992779,"text":"RPC架构"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}